{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mooshie's Kitchen was once a place of fun and joy for decades until it shut down in 2023. Since then, it's been surrounded in rumor and mystery. What could have happened on the day of Mooshie's Kitchen's closure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/654683804a8a2463bdfd2029ad3e6fc2.poster.avif?t=1761266300\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/654683804a8a2463bdfd2029ad3e6fc2.webm?t=1761266300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/654683804a8a2463bdfd2029ad3e6fc2.mp4?t=1761266300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/f64ac0a8885f7f5a373a9bfa618e8cba.avif?t=1761266300\" width=512 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around a year after Mooshie's Kitchen's closure, Bread and his two best friends, Vlad and Chad, decide to explore the once lively restaurant late in the night for an online video. Little do they know the truth they are about to uncover and what is currently go on behind the boarded-up doors of Mooshie's Kitchen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings, interact with things, solve puzzles, meet new characters, get spooked, and experience the story of what happened to the once-beloved restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/5d849967e87804fff25284eb40d8edbf.poster.avif?t=1761266300\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/5d849967e87804fff25284eb40d8edbf.webm?t=1761266300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/5d849967e87804fff25284eb40d8edbf.mp4?t=1761266300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/42608b15c395491578bcd10ff61c5cdd.avif?t=1761266300\" width=512 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mooshie's Kitchen: Reheated takes place over the course of three acts from the perspectives of three different characters important to the story. Each act also has a &quot;mini act&quot; or mini story that can be unlocked by collecting all the collectable stickers found in each main act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/a51b233102eb78724f9cd45bc98c0b58.poster.avif?t=1761266300\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/a51b233102eb78724f9cd45bc98c0b58.webm?t=1761266300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/a51b233102eb78724f9cd45bc98c0b58.mp4?t=1761266300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/fbd1083759951b2586be3b2d23481e88.avif?t=1761266300\" width=512 height=104 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed camera system inspired by classic survival horror games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional first-person mode for those who prefer a different perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on story, mystery, and lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three acts played from the perspectives of three different characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three mini stories that can be unlocked by collecting all the collectable stickers found in each of the three main acts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of unique characters to meet as the story progresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop-motion animation style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claymation-like art style</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4096700?t=1761266300","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/ee84a45d05efe16de7fb560d921fc9d3b702f53e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761266300","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/65a1097028e34e7278767868f8b10eaa305396ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761266300","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/65a1097028e34e7278767868f8b10eaa305396ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761266300","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game may contain content not appropriate for all ages including: Violence, occasional swearing, and horror themes"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mooshie's Kitchen was once a place of fun and joy for decades until it shut down in 2023. Since then, it's been surrounded in rumor and mystery. What could have happened on the day of Mooshie's Kitchen's closure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/654683804a8a2463bdfd2029ad3e6fc2.poster.avif?t=1761266300\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/654683804a8a2463bdfd2029ad3e6fc2.webm?t=1761266300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/654683804a8a2463bdfd2029ad3e6fc2.mp4?t=1761266300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/f64ac0a8885f7f5a373a9bfa618e8cba.avif?t=1761266300\" width=512 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around a year after Mooshie's Kitchen's closure, Bread and his two best friends, Vlad and Chad, decide to explore the once lively restaurant late in the night for an online video. Little do they know the truth they are about to uncover and what is currently go on behind the boarded-up doors of Mooshie's Kitchen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings, interact with things, solve puzzles, meet new characters, get spooked, and experience the story of what happened to the once-beloved restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/5d849967e87804fff25284eb40d8edbf.poster.avif?t=1761266300\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/5d849967e87804fff25284eb40d8edbf.webm?t=1761266300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/5d849967e87804fff25284eb40d8edbf.mp4?t=1761266300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/42608b15c395491578bcd10ff61c5cdd.avif?t=1761266300\" width=512 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mooshie's Kitchen: Reheated takes place over the course of three acts from the perspectives of three different characters important to the story. Each act also has a &quot;mini act&quot; or mini story that can be unlocked by collecting all the collectable stickers found in each main act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/a51b233102eb78724f9cd45bc98c0b58.poster.avif?t=1761266300\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/a51b233102eb78724f9cd45bc98c0b58.webm?t=1761266300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/a51b233102eb78724f9cd45bc98c0b58.mp4?t=1761266300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096700/extras/fbd1083759951b2586be3b2d23481e88.avif?t=1761266300\" width=512 height=104 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed camera system inspired by classic survival horror games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional first-person mode for those who prefer a different perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on story, mystery, and lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three acts played from the perspectives of three different characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_parag